Package: com.xyrith.xrhea
Name: xrhea
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Battery and charging tweak for iOS 17: detailed battery info, a charge limit with scheduled full charge, heat protection, Low Power Mode automation with 120 Hz kept, and Dynamic Island alerts. Only tested on iOS 17.3.1; requires a roothide jailbreak.
Maintainer: xyrith
Author: xyrith
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
